 curious you  can go watch it when I say Elden ring  saved my life I truly mean it I was lost  and I feel like I've learned so many  lessons this year because of Elden ring  that I feel like a new better person  because of it all I want to do is make  good content for you all to enjoy and  that's what I plan to do all of next  year Elden ring has actually made me  start studying cinematography so I can  continue to make my videos better and  better every time I release a new video  I had planned on releasing a video  series called the fallen leaves that was  almost too ambitious of a project to do  completely on my own it was going to be  a literal TV show that would depict a  character named Rick voice acted by  myself going through the lands between  two hopefully better illustrate the lore  of Elden ring in a cinematic Hollywood  style I got the first episode done and  unfortunately the power went out in my  house while I had my computer on with my  editing software open as well this  caused all of my footage to look and  sound distorted and after days of  researching and attempting to fix this  issue nothing worked and I eventually  gave up this destroyed my motivation as  an entire month of work was just gone in  an instant after some time I told myself  that this was just another challenge  that I needed to overcome to better  myself as a person and as a Creator  eventually I released my first cinematic  Story video of Latina's Quest  and I could not be more proud of how  this video turned out it is my favorite  video I have ever made and I have Elden  ring to thank for it every inch of Elden  ring just looks like it was ripped out  of a painting So creating cinematic  shots to better showcase how beautiful  this game truly is just makes me happy  it is so much fun and I don't see myself  doing anything else for the foreseeable  future I had been waiting for a game  like Elder ring to come out my entire  life for me it is the perfect game that  I was ecstatic 